Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.00,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I’ve had enough...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.51,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Why’d the AC have to break \N {\i1}today{\i0} of all days...?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.51,0:00:30.01,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Orio’s working like mad \N to fix it for us...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.76,0:00:38.48,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ugh. Feel like I can’t be bothered \N to do anything...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.48,0:00:43.27,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Same for Navi. \N So hot, so fed up...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.52,0:00:49.07,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,{\q2}It’s practically a sauna in there. \N There {\i1}couldn’t{\i0} possibly be a bigger waste of time than—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.07,0:00:50.91,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.41,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,You’re slacking, Rising Voltteccers!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.95,0:00:58.91,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,“Is this abnormal heat wave \N an omen of a super{chou} ice age?! {super-ice age seems to be a job-related term in JP from google results, but probably irrelevant and just sticking an intensifier on ice age}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.91,0:01:02.13,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,“What mysteries await \N once Ice-type Pokémon proliferate?!”{What are the mysteries of Ice-type Pokemon becoming active!}{same active as Ugatsu homura / Rakua, but 'active' feels a bit bland for taking over the world}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.13,0:01:03.96,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}there’s{\i0} a scoop!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.17,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.96,0:01:05.17,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.59,0:01:07.05,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Sohdayo{Honorifics note: Sohdayo-san}?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.05,0:01:12.01,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Yup! Sohdayo, in pursuit of \N the unfabricated truth; that’s me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.01,0:01:13.85,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,It’s been a while, guys!
Comment: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:14.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:44.52,0:02:44.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.95,0:02:57.03,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A Pokémon Journalist?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.03,0:03:01.74,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah. Mr. Sohdayo{Honorifics note: Sohdayo-san} is a former member \N of the Rising Voltteccers...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.04,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,...and a globe-trotting reporter!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.04,0:03:07.29,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,He’s even written \N an article on us before.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.29,0:03:13.55,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,The truth-seeking Pokémon Journalist, \N Sohtim da Yotim! For short, Sohdayo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.55,0:03:16.97,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,And this is my partner, Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.30,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.30,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.30,0:03:23.02,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,A truth-seeking Pokémon Journalist... \N So cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.02,0:03:25.81,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Heh, gettin’ all excited... \N {\i1}Such{\i0} a little kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.81,0:03:29.73,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,{\i1}You’re{\i0} the little kid \N for calling me one! Nyah-nyah!{142}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.98,0:03:35.49,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Hmph. \N Sohdayo’s just a deceitful dimwit.{inchiki tonchiki | Just a cheat/quack/fraud and a dimwit/doofus, but the two words rhyme}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.49,0:03:37.03,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Non, non!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.03,0:03:39.87,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,There are countless truths \N decried as deceitful!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.87,0:03:43.74,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Deception is a looking-glass{same term as the gen 5 mirror key item, ENgame: Reveal Glass} \N that reflects the truth, Molly.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.74,0:03:44.79,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.74,0:03:44.79,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.79,0:03:48.21,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,There’s not even a hint of truth \N to be found in you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.21,0:03:51.54,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Hey, hey... \N Is that any way to speak to your senior{Honorifics note: senpai}?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.54,0:03:54.38,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,By two days! \N I {\i1}still{\i} wish I could go back and change that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.38,0:03:58.26,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Oh, that reminds me! You hear the rumors \N of the Pokémon that can alter the past?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.80,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,{\i1}No,{\i0} I have {\i1}not!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.89,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Same old routine with them...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.89,0:04:05.60,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I wonder if Mr. Sohdayo{Honorifics note: Sohdayo-san}’s on the trail \N of something strange again.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.06,0:04:09.02,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Wanna hear what, youngsters?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.02,0:04:09.94,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.94,0:04:11.40,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,N-Not...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.40,0:04:14.36,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Okay, okay! Say no more!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.36,0:04:18.28,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,I’m here to gather material for a special feature \N that’ll be in the next Occulture.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.28,0:04:19.95,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Occulture?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.82,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Yes. I call it...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.82,0:04:25.95,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,“Astonishing! \N The Enigmatic Land of Mystery: Area Delta”!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.91,0:04:28.96,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Area Delta?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.37,0:04:33.59,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Area Delta, \N said to be located south of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.00,0:04:39.09,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Shrouded amidst triangular rocks, \N it’s said to be the entrance to another world.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.63,0:04:46.68,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,{\q2}And on the night of the full moon, \N it’s the site of eerie cursed dances to repel intruders...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.27,0:04:51.94,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Anyone who still {\i1}dares{\i0} tread inside \N receives a harsh welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.27,0:04:56.44,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Assaults from rampaging rocks \N and fierce gales,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.44,0:04:59.70,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,as well as burns from blazing hellfire, \N as one account has it...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.82,0:05:05.08,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,And I’ve yet to mention \N Area Delta’s {\i1}greatest{\i0} mystery...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.08,0:05:10.58,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,A terrifying Pokémon \N that drags intruders off to another world!
Comment: 10,0:05:10.58,0:05:13.08,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eeeeek!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.96,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.96,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wh-What Pokémon is it...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.13,0:05:20.63,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,The answer will knock you flat!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.63,0:05:24.10,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,The Pokémon that is \N legend among legends: Rekkuuza!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.10,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,And it’s no ordinary Rekkuuza.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.10,0:05:30.39,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,It’s eaten a meteor in the ozone layer, \N taken in its energy, and Mega Evolved...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.39,0:05:32.69,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,...into Mega Rekkuuza!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.69,0:05:34.52,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mega Rekkuuza?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.52,0:05:36.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whoa! Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.69,0:05:37.90,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You serious?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.74,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, but we...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.74,0:05:40.78,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.24,0:05:45.70,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,I know all too well of your profound connection \N with the black Rekkuuza.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.66,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Which is why I came here!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.16,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.66,0:05:53.08,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Since you guys managed to \N form a bond with the black Rekkuuza,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.08,0:05:56.79,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,I thought you might be able to \N get through to Mega Rekkuuza, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.79,0:05:59.92,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,You’ll be able to delve into \N the mysteries of Area Delta!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.92,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.92,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.72,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Give it up, Sohdayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.72,0:06:07.35,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Stop involving the kids \N in your dimwitted tales.{tonchiki}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.35,0:06:11.56,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Aha, I hear you, Molly. \N {\i1}You{\i} want to come along too!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.48,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.48,0:06:17.40,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Very well! I shall let you gaze into \N the abyss of truth, like old times!{for the first time in a long time!}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.40,0:06:18.44,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.40,0:06:18.44,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.94,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.95,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Well, I’m feeling the heat less, \N thanks to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.49,0:06:28.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Right now, we’re a little...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.95,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Say no more!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.50,0:06:37.21,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,I know how you feel. \N You all want to accompany me to Area Delta.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.34,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.34,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.59,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wanna go with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.59,0:06:41.67,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.67,0:06:42.47,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.47,0:06:46.22,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I admire Occulture, so getting to \N tag along on research for it...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s a golden opportunity!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.47,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Please take us there!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.47,0:06:52.85,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Ooh! Girls with such a gleam \N in their eyes!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.85,0:06:54.56,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Now there’s a fine sight to see!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.56,0:06:58.23,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Then, on the full moon’s night... \N We depart at sunset!{note for edit: full moon's night seems to be tonight, but that's not stated}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.11,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.65,0:07:00.11,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.11,0:07:04.11,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Me too, me too! \N I’m gonna catch that Mega Rekkuuza for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.11,0:07:05.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi wants to see it, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.95,0:07:09.37,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,We’re leaving at {\i1}night.{\i} \N You won’t be awake then.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.37,0:07:10.83,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi {\i1}will{\i0} be awake!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.83,0:07:14.33,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m definitely, {\i1}definitely{\i0} going!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.63,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,She didn’t manage to stay up, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.63,0:07:27.72,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,She said she was too excited \N to nap during the day...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.72,0:07:31.22,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Heh! It’s a relief \N not havin’ that loudmouth around!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.22,0:07:35.73,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,The real loudmouth here’s you... \N {\i1}haaah{\i0}{yawn}... Ult.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.11,0:07:47.24,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Wow! Look, everyone! \N  Good omens ahead!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.24,0:07:48.57,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.57,0:07:49.62,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,The stars?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.25,0:07:59.33,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}There’re green stars forming a triangle, \N and small stars stretching out like whiskers, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.33,0:08:03.75,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,{\q2\an8}That’s none other than the captivating \N summer constellation: the Mega Rekkuustellation!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.75,0:08:05.26,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mega Rekkuu... stellation?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.26,0:08:06.88,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is that a thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.88,0:08:08.13,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,{\an8}I’ve never heard of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.13,0:08:11.76,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,{\an8}Naturally! \N Because I made it up just now!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.51,0:08:19.73,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,{\q2}Shocking! When the Mega Rekkuustellation looms \N in the southern sky, Mega Rekkuuza will show itself!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.40,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.40,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.40,0:08:25.90,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,And it will lead us to \N another world in Area Delta!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.90,0:08:27.03,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.90,0:08:27.03,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.40,0:08:31.91,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Aw man, I’m {\i1}itchin’{\i0} to go! \N Just you wait, Mega Rekkuuza!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.91,0:08:34.16,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,That’s the spirit, boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.16,0:08:37.16,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah! I’ll do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.16,0:08:39.04,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.16,0:08:39.04,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.43,0:08:51.93,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s a Bulbeat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.93,0:08:55.43,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They talk with their friends \N by flashing the lights on their rears.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.43,0:08:57.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow... It’s so pretty!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.19,0:09:05.44,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That Gamale’s going after \N the Mitsuhoney’s honey!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.44,0:09:07.32,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ooh, you’re right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Somethin’ there!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.03,0:09:18.33,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s a Donkarasu \N leading a flock of Yamikarasu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.33,0:09:20.71,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,This’ll make for a nice shot!{I can take a good shot!}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.71,0:09:30.09,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,We’ve arrived, youngsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.63,0:09:33.59,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,This is Area Delta!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.43,0:09:36.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.85,0:09:41.31,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It looks like any old rocky place...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.06,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Look! A triangular rock!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.06,0:09:46.32,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh, you’re right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.32,0:09:49.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you {\i1}could{\i0} \N call it triangular...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.28,0:09:54.32,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,And those dead branches \N form a triangle!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.87,0:09:58.54,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,And if you connect them with that flat rock, \N they form a triangle!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.54,0:09:59.62,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.54,0:09:59.62,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.62,0:10:02.58,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,W-Well... Maybe, I guess?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.58,0:10:07.17,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,We’ve already intruded upon \N the Land of Mystery: Area Delta.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.17,0:10:10.80,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Watch your step, youngsters. \N Anything could happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.55,0:10:16.80,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Now, it’s time to bust out \N my secret weapon!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.26,0:10:18.81,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Ta-daah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.85,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ooh! What’s that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.35,0:10:23.44,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa, so cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.44,0:10:24.44,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.44,0:10:28.61,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,This is a device to lure out \N Mega Rekkuuza!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.61,0:10:29.86,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You made that?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.86,0:10:31.69,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,I bought it in an online auction!{opted against won since he specifically says bought, could be a buy now auction}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.44,0:10:34.95,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Switch... on!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.70,0:10:40.70,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Nothing’s happening.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.17,0:10:48.71,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.71,0:10:50.75,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I-Is this...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.75,0:10:51.84,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.72,0:11:00.76,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,The door to another world \N has opened!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.76,0:11:03.48,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,A-Another world?!
Comment: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:08.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.86,0:11:16.49,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,A-Another world?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.37,0:11:25.92,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,This must be the cursed dance \N held on full moon nights!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.92,0:11:27.46,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Everyone, watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.46,0:11:28.58,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.46,0:11:28.58,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,No, hold on, those are...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.47,0:11:38.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Pippi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.22,0:11:41.51,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Aww, how cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.65,0:11:55.19,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Pippi. Fairy Pokémon. Fairy type.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.19,0:12:00.16,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,On nights with a full moon, \N Pippi gather from places unknown and dance.{On full moon nights, gathering from out of nowhere, Pippi start dancing.}{ENgame: gather from all over}{Tried to capture more 'appearing from places untold' - suddenly they're there and you don't know where they came from}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.66,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Bathing in the moonlight, they float.{Scarlet dex entry}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.08,0:12:07.67,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Awesome! We get to watch a Pippi dance! \N That’s an ultra-rare{yep, gamey jargon} experience!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.39,0:12:22.22,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That looks fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.22,0:12:26.35,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Marvelous! \N Pokémon in synchronized night dance!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.35,0:12:29.44,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,As if enacting a ritual \N to communicate with the moon!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.19,0:12:31.65,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.19,0:12:31.65,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.71,0:12:49.08,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,R-R...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Roy?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.00,0:12:52.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Rocks!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.63,0:12:54.88,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.34,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone! Charm Voice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.55,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami! Power Gem!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.43,0:13:07.52,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.39,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,But why did those rocks fall?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.39,0:13:13.31,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Area Delta itself \N is repelling our intrusion.{repeat of the word from the repel intruders line}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.31,0:13:14.65,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.31,0:13:14.65,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.02,0:13:16.48,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You serious?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.82,0:13:23.41,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya! Magical Leaf!
Comment: 10,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.54,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.09,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival! Aqua Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.88,0:13:39.13,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.68,0:13:46.93,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Everyone! Flee into there!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.86,0:13:58.07,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Are we in the clear...?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.07,0:13:59.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Is this place...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.65,0:14:05.57,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,One... Two... Three...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.03,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,The Triangular Room!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.03,0:14:09.91,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,This is the deepest point \N of Area Delta!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.29,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.29,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.29,0:14:14.08,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It just looks like \N some open space to me...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.71,0:14:16.71,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,No, he could be right.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.71,0:14:17.50,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.50,0:14:21.22,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,The things Mr. Sohdayo{Honorifics note: Sohdayo-san} told us \N about Area Delta before we left...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.88,0:14:25.26,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Pippi may have been behind it, \N but the cursed dance was Riolu{real}...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.64,0:14:27.76,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Oh, the rampaging rocks!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.76,0:14:29.77,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And the fierce winds!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.77,0:14:33.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,And the burn-y... whatever-it-was-fire! {TL: And the burn...y-whatever fire!}{I don't really like any formatting option I can think of... bleh. -ed}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.52,0:14:38.90,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Sohnano...{That’s right... | そうなの on one set of captions, Pokemon name on the other} \N Everything Mr. Sohdayo{Honorifics note: Sohdayo-san} said was true!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.90,0:14:43.40,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Exactly! We have gazed into \N the abyss of the truth!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.40,0:14:46.20,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Truly, the truth is what we make it!{Different wording this time, 'we', as opposed to you in past eps}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.20,0:14:48.78,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,The greatest mystery \N will soon be unveiled!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.78,0:14:49.87,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Mr. Sohdayo{Honorifics note: Sohdayo-san}!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.87,0:14:50.49,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.87,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.00,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.75,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Could this be...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.75,0:15:01.76,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Here it comes! \N The greatest mystery!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.35,0:15:18.56,Main,Roy Ult,0,0,0,,Mega Rekkuuza!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.70,0:15:29.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.45,0:15:32.54,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’re... floating?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.70,0:15:36.21,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.21,0:15:39.75,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow, so many Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.38,0:15:42.55,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa, awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.21,0:15:46.97,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,It’s the guidance of \N the Mega Rekkuuza!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.97,0:15:49.85,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,It’s taken us to \N some mysterious other world!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.22,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.22,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.35,0:15:59.61,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Whoa, what a shock! \N Mega Rekkuuza returns!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.61,0:16:02.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Whoa, awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.15,0:16:04.74,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s so rare, \N I’m shocked all oveRishan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.74,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Then I’ll take you on in battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.74,0:16:17.50,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! \N I’ll catch you! Let’s go, Yamirami!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.63,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Draconic Masterstroke \N is neaRunpappa! {Draconic Masterstroke is comi[ngRu]npappa!}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.38,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s dangerous!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.43,0:16:34.26,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami got...!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.26,0:16:36.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Eek! Oh dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.27,0:16:39.02,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wow! Was it hungry?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.44,0:16:42.56,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,So a Mega Rekkuuza’s \N favorite food is Yamirami?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.56,0:16:44.78,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,This is the discovery of the century!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.49,0:16:54.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow, oh dear, oh dear!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.49,0:16:57.16,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wow! Cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.16,0:17:01.25,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami... \N Did you... gaze upon the truth?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.84,0:17:12.76,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,{\q2}Marvelous! \N Mega Rekkuuza and Pokémon performing together!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.76,0:17:15.01,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,The ultimate showtime!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.01,0:17:16.60,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.01,0:17:16.60,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.60,0:17:22.65,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yay! Wanival, let’s get in on \N the dancinGusokumusha!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.61,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They’re really grooving!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.61,0:17:26.65,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yay, yay, yay, yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.99,0:17:33.12,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I have gazed upon the abyss of truth.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.12,0:17:35.41,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,The charming, mysterious, \N and mega-strongest.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.41,0:17:38.41,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami! Power Gem!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.59,0:17:52.84,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Whoa, what an upset!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.84,0:17:56.18,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Mega Rekkuuza went down \N to one hit from Yamirami!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.18,0:17:58.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,My, my, my, my, my, my?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.02,0:18:00.73,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wow, wow, wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.73,0:18:02.89,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,As our unfabricated promise foretold...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.81,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Accept your capture!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.71,0:18:26.71,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.71,0:18:29.59,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Just now, we were doing... \N whaTairetsu?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.13,0:18:32.17,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.22,0:18:35.09,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Th-That was...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.09,0:18:37.64,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,An unmistakable \N paranormal phenomenon!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.64,0:18:41.48,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,We have wandered \N into another world!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.48,0:18:43.23,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.48,0:18:43.23,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.40,0:18:47.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What’s that...?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.86,0:18:54.11,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Of course... The Pippi’s dance!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.11,0:18:54.86,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Dance?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.24,0:18:57.87,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Look. They’re Wagging Fingers \N while dancing.{conjugated}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.37,0:19:03.12,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Pippi’s Wag Finger activates \N various different moves at random...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.79,0:19:07.00,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So maybe they used Eerie Light \N or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.38,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Then that means we...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.38,0:19:11.13,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,...were confused...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.51,0:19:14.30,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey! Where’s the Mega Rekkuuza?!
Comment: 10,0:19:16.55,0:19:17.14,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?
Comment: 10,0:19:18.51,0:19:19.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Comment: 10,0:19:20.14,0:19:21.18,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.52,0:19:25.31,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,An Arbo... \N An alternate-color one, at that!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.31,0:19:28.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Whoa, I’ve never seen one before! \N They’re super rare!{not a gaming term}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.56,0:19:31.36,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Could that mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.90,0:19:35.74,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,...this Arbo was the Mega Rekkuuza?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.74,0:19:37.99,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What?! You serious?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.99,0:19:41.33,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,What a mysterious, \N wonderful, unusual experience!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.33,0:19:44.04,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,My upcoming special feature’s \N going to be {\i1}superb!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.04,0:19:47.00,Main,Sohdayo,0,0,0,,Thank you, Area Delta!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.62,0:19:48.83,Main,Sohnano,0,0,0,,Sohnano?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.62,0:19:48.83,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Is that right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.75,0:19:52.67,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Everyone, look!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.67,0:19:55.67,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They updated with the new Occulture.{koushin: update/(refresh a webpage), being probably used to mean 'added'}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.67,0:19:57.76,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What about Mr. Sohdayo{Honorifics note: Sohdayo-san}’s article?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.68,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Did he write about us?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.68,0:20:03.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That was that time Ult thought \N he saw a Mega Rekkuuza, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.39,0:20:05.73,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Shut it! You were asleep!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.73,0:20:07.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Only cause you didn’t wake me up!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.94,0:20:10.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Aww, Navi wanted to go too...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.48,0:20:15.03,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“And so, having escaped \N the cursed dance,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.03,0:20:18.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“we wandered into another world \N by the guidance of the Mega Rekkuuza.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.66,0:20:22.91,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“The truth of the Land of Mystery, \N Area Delta will now be revealed!”
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.91,0:20:23.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.99,0:20:25.33,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,There’s photos!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.46,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,They’re all blurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.46,0:20:33.46,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“Unfortunately, some kind of interference \N kept us from capturing the other world on film.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.46,0:20:36.34,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“But this interference \N only proves it was real!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.34,0:20:39.51,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,“We will continue to pursue the truth!”
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.51,0:20:41.72,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? But that...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.18,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,...didn’t reveal any truth at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.18,0:20:45.52,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.98,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,He’s a deceitful dimwit.{inchiki tonchiki}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.98,0:20:51.15,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Well, this is typical for Occulture...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.15,0:20:55.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,B-But still, I saw the Pippi’s dance, \N so I enjoyed it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.44,0:20:58.11,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So jealous! \N Navi wanted to see it, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.11,0:21:02.12,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Even if it was an illusion{maboroshi}, \N you met Mega Rekkuuza! Not fair!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.12,0:21:04.41,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Argh, but I wanted to {\i1}catch{\i0} it!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.41,0:21:08.37,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\q2}You even had the guidance of \N the Mega Rekkuustellation hanging in the night sky.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.92,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s not something you can \N expect to see every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.92,0:21:13.13,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Though it’d be incredible \N if it really did show up.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.63,0:21:17.63,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That reminds me, \N didn’t you tell us before, Molly?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.63,0:21:20.63,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,When Sohnano says \N “Sohnano!” with certainty...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.63,0:21:25.01,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Yeah. It means Sohdayo’s \N telling the truth for once.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.01,0:21:29.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So, how did it respond to \N the Mega Rekkuustellation?
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.83,0:21:48.20,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.20,0:21:51.79,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.75,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Rekkuuza!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.75,0:21:59.71,Main,Friede,150,0,0,,Apparently, eating something \N is important for it to Mega Evolve,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.71,0:22:01.51,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,but do you know what thing that is?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.22,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.44,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.44,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.11,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,B: A meteorite!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.11,0:23:51.62,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,By eating a meteorite and storing the energy \N in its body, it gains the ability to Mega Evolve!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.00,0:23:55.16,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Shooting stars!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.16,0:23:57.00,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn’t that...?
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.84,0:24:08.72,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What do I do? \N Wanival and Dekanuchan can’t sleep!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.72,0:24:10.68,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? Not one wink?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.68,0:24:12.43,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,If they nod off, \N they wake up right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.43,0:24:16.69,Main,Professor Neroli,0,0,0,,That sounds like trouble. \N Sleep is very important, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.69,0:24:17.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Who’re you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.15,0:24:22.36,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.36,0:24:25.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wanival and Dekanuchan, \N the Great Sleep Operation!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.44,0:24:28.32,Main,Professor Neroli,0,0,0,,Everyone, eat well and sleep well!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.32,0:24:30.45,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who are you, already?!{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
